      "content": "Addressing the concerns about nausea and efficacy delta, you can frame your product's benefits in a more nuanced way, focusing on the overall patient experience rather than strict efficacy metrics. Highlighting the comfort and ease of use features of your product, such as a well-designed tablet or a user-friendly dosing system, can also help shift the conversation towards the patient benefits. By using phrases like \"FOR A TIME\"_ pressure intolerable to generic painkillers or emphasizing how  plus comparison exquisite comfortattributes\", you can maintain these messaging without having to make exaggerated claims.",
